        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: The Hours, Suburbicon\n- People: Julianne Moore, Nicole Kidman, Meryl Streep, Matt Damon, Oscar Isaac\n- Awards: Pulitzer Prize for Fiction, PEN/Faulkner Award for Fiction, Academy Award for Best Actress\n\nFacts:\n- The Hours won the 1999 Pulitzer Prize for Fiction.\n- The Hours won the 1999 PEN/Faulkner Award for Fiction.\n- The Hours was later adapted into an Oscar-winning 2002 film of the same name starring Nicole Kidman, Meryl Streep, and Julianne Moore.\n- Julianne Moore is particularly known for portraying emotionally troubled women in both independent and Hollywood films.\n- Julianne Moore received the 2014 Academy Award for Best Actress.\n- Suburbicon stars Matt Damon, Julianne Moore, and Oscar Isaac.",
